# swiftly per-directory toolchain pin (set by `swiftly use`); a deliberate CI pin comes later
.swift-version
# Exception: keep the Mac App Store Xcode project's manifest in git so it's recoverable
# if lost (it's the one un-versioned, hand-edited artifact). The SPM / Developer-ID
# GitHub build never reads it, so tracking it doesn't affect that channel. User-specific
# Xcode state (xcuserdata) stays ignored.
!/app/NetLights/NetLights.xcodeproj/
/app/NetLights/NetLights.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
/app/NetLights/NetLights.xcodeproj/**/xcuserdata/

# Local-only collaboration notes
docs/AI-ASSIST.md

# Scratch scratch-path used to build Core as a standalone module for off-Linux parser tests
.build-lh/

# Adversarial review findings — local working notes, see .arf/README.md
.arf/
